          "start": 97,
          "end": 116
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, without commenting upon the merits and circumstances of the present case, the present petition is allowed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3635732fbaf44e469a814ecf6e5fcee8_83",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The petitioner is ordered to be released on bail, on furnishing of bail bond and surety bond to the satisfaction of concerned Chief Judicial Magistrate/trial Court/Duty Magistrate."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "52177121a5db42019701fecbd6bb0592_84",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. However, it is clarified that if in future, the petitioner is found indulging in commission of similar offences, as are involved herein, the respondent- State shall be at liberty to make an appropriate application seeking cancellation o"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "401c1753120047bdb34b814aabec99b4_85",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
